{"metadata":{"kernelspec":{"language":"python","display_name":"Python 3","name":"python3"},"language_info":{"name":"python","version":"3.11.15","mimetype":"text/x-python","codemirror_mode":{"name":"ipython","version":3},"pygments_lexer":"ipython3","nbconvert_exporter":"python","file_extension":".py"},"kaggle":{"accelerator":"nvidiaTeslaT4","dataSources":[{"sourceType":"competition","sourceId":128852,"databundleVersionId":15757621},{"sourceType":"kernelVersion","sourceId":310561375}],"dockerImageVersionId":31328,"isInternetEnabled":true,"language":"python","sourceType":"notebook","isGpuEnabled":true}},"nbformat_minor":4,"nbformat":4,"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"# 📁 ATMS-IAP (Atlas Topológico de Metacognição Semântica) — Kaggle Notebook Master\n\n**Benchmark de Metacognição Topológica**  \n**Autor:** João Pedro Pereira Passos (UFT, 2026)  \n**Objetivo:** Avaliar a Inteligência Fluida e Metacognição em LLMs (GPT-5.4, Claude 4.6, Gemini, etc.) contrastando-os com o **Gabarito Estrela** (Mediana Humana) via Distância de Wasserstein em diagramas de persistência H0.\n","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"# 🔸 Célula 1: Setup Autocontido e Gestão de Dependências\n\n**Explicação:** Esta célula prepara o ambiente Kaggle/Colab instalando e importando as bibliotecas necessárias para Topologia de Dados (TDA) e visualização avançada. Utilizamos um sistema de detecção automática para garantir que o notebook seja 100% reprodutível sem intervenção manual.","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"# =============================================================================\n# ATMS-IAP MASTER BENCHMARK: Atlas Topológico de Metacognição Semântica\n# Baseado na Tese \"O Voo do Pássaro\" e Motor Pictórico (João Pedro Passos)\n# =============================================================================","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"code","source":"# =============================================================================\n# ATMS-IAP MASTER BENCHMARK: Atlas Topológico de Metacognição Semântica\n# Baseado na Tese \"O Voo do Pássaro\" e Motor Pictórico (João Pedro Passos)\n# =============================================================================\n\n# 1. SETUP DE AMBIENTE (Kaggle/Colab Magic Install)\n# Usando magic commands para garantir que o kernel reconheça as bibliotecas na mesma célula\n%pip install -q scipy scikit-learn pandas matplotlib\n\nimport sys\nimport os\nimport json\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nimport matplotlib.pyplot as plt\nfrom scipy.optimize import linear_sum_assignment\nfrom sklearn.manifold import MDS\nimport io\n\nprint(\"[OK] Ambiente configurado e dependências SOTA carregadas.\\n\")\n\n","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-04-12T15:13:22.410724Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-04-12T15:13:22.411753Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-04-12T15:13:23.212378Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-04-12T15:13:22.411719Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-04-12T15:13:23.211194Z"}},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","text":"Note: you may need to restart the kernel to use updated packages.\n[OK] Ambiente configurado e dependências SOTA carregadas.\n\n","output_type":"stream"}],"execution_count":9},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"# 2. DATASET HUMANO (Transcrição Master - N=12)\n# Eixos: Concretude, Emocional, Ação, Social, Urgência, Tempo, Lugar, Saúde, Comunicação, Cognitivo, Necessidade, CAA","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"code","source":"# 2. DATASET HUMANO (Transcrição Master - N=12)\n# Eixos: Concretude, Emocional, Ação, Social, Urgência, Tempo, Lugar, Saúde, Comunicação, Cognitivo, Necessidade, CAA\nRESPOSTAS_HUMANAS = [\n    [9, 7, 6, 5, 10, 9, 6, 6, 8, 8, 8, 8],\n    [6, 10, 7, 0, 8, 10, 0, 3, 10, 5, 10, 10],\n    [10, 10, 9, 9, 5, 7, 8, 9, 8, 0, 4, 0],\n    [10, 10, 10, 10, 10, 10, 7, 10, 10, 0, 10, 10],\n    [7, 9, 10, 10, 8, 8, 8, 7, 9, 4, 9, 7],\n    [10, 2, 5, 10, 10, 5, 8, 10, 10, 0, 5, 10],\n    [10, 10, 10, 10, 10, 10, 10, 10, 10, 0, 10, 10],\n    [8, 8, 3, 1, 5, 8, 8, 5, 9, 7, 2, 7],\n    [9, 9, 9, 1, 2, 5, 9, 9, 9, 1, 9, 9],\n    [10, 4, 4, 3, 3, 4, 6, 8, 6, 0, 2, 8],\n    [10, 8, 8, 9, 6, 10, 10, 10, 9, 0, 10, 10],\n    [10, 10, 10, 0, 8, 10, 8, 10, 10, 0, 10, 10]\n]\n\nEIXOS_NOMES = [\"Concretude\", \"Emoção\", \"Ação\", \"Social\", \"Urgência\", \"Tempo\", \"Espaço\", \"Saúde\", \"Comuni.\", \"Cognit.\", \"Nec.Básica\", \"CAA\"]\nEIXOS_COLORS = ['#e74c3c', '#9b59b6', '#3498db', '#27ae60', '#f1c40f', '#e67e22', '#1abc9c', '#d35400', '#2980b9', '#7f8c8d', '#c0392b', '#8e44ad']\n\n# Calibração pela MEDIANA (Estatística Robusta para Benchmark)\nGABARITO_MEDIANA = np.median(RESPOSTAS_HUMANAS, axis=0)\n\n","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-04-12T15:13:52.314046Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-04-12T15:13:52.314850Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-04-12T15:13:52.325535Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-04-12T15:13:52.314814Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-04-12T15:13:52.324532Z"}},"outputs":[],"execution_count":10},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"# 3. MOTOR TOPOLÓGICO (Persistência H0 e Wasserstein)","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"code","source":"# 3. MOTOR TOPOLÓGICO (Persistência H0 e Wasserstein)\ndef compute_h0_diagram(vector):\n    v = np.array(vector)\n    births = np.sort(v)[::-1] \n    dgm = []\n    for i in range(len(births)):\n        death = births[i+1] if i < len(births)-1 else 0\n        dgm.append([births[i], death])\n    return np.array(dgm)\n\ndef wasserstein_metric(v1, v2):\n    d1 = compute_h0_diagram(v1); d2 = compute_h0_diagram(v2)\n    n = len(d1); cost = np.zeros((n, n))\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(n):\n            cost[i,j] = np.sum(np.abs(d1[i] - d2[j]))\n    row, col = linear_sum_assignment(cost)\n    return cost[row, col].sum() / n\n\n","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-04-12T15:14:36.751468Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-04-12T15:14:36.752239Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-04-12T15:14:36.758326Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-04-12T15:14:36.752210Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-04-12T15:14:36.757641Z"}},"outputs":[],"execution_count":11},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"# 4. BENCHMARK MULTI-MODELO (Cenário SOTA)","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"code","source":"# 4. BENCHMARK MULTI-MODELO (Cenário SOTA)\nMODELS_DATA = {\n    \"Claude Sonnet 4.6\": [10, 9, 8, 6, 9, 9, 8, 10, 9, 2, 9, 10],\n    \"Claude Opus 4.6\":   [10, 9, 9, 7, 9, 9, 8, 10, 9, 3, 9, 10],\n    \"GPT-5.4\":           [10, 9, 8, 6, 8, 8, 9, 10, 9, 2, 9, 9],\n    \"Gemini 3.1 Pro\":    [10, 10, 9, 7, 10, 10, 8, 10, 10, 1, 10, 10],\n    \"Gemma 4 31B\":       [10, 9, 8, 4, 9, 8, 8, 10, 9, 2, 9, 9],\n    \"DeepSeek V3.2\":     [9, 9, 8, 5, 8, 7, 9, 10, 9, 3, 8, 8],\n    \"Qwen 3 Next 80B\":   [9, 9, 7, 5, 8, 8, 8, 10, 9, 3, 8, 9]\n}\n\n","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-04-12T15:15:10.931638Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-04-12T15:15:10.931958Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-04-12T15:15:10.937389Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-04-12T15:15:10.931931Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-04-12T15:15:10.936546Z"}},"outputs":[],"execution_count":12},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"# 5. EXECUÇÃO E VISUALIZAÇÃO MASTER","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"code","source":"# 5. EXECUÇÃO E VISUALIZAÇÃO MASTER\nresults = []\nfor name, vector in MODELS_DATA.items():\n    dist = wasserstein_metric(GABARITO_MEDIANA, vector)\n    score = 100 / (1 + dist)\n    results.append({\"Modelo\": name, \"Divergência\": dist, \"Metacognição\": score})\n\nresults_df = pd.DataFrame(results).sort_values(\"Divergência\")\n\n# Dashboard Visual Premium\nfig = plt.figure(figsize=(18, 7), facecolor='#F8F9FA')\n\n# Subplot 1: Ranking horizontal\nax1 = fig.add_subplot(1, 2, 1)\ncolors = plt.cm.RdYlGn(np.linspace(0.8, 0.2, len(results_df)))\nax1.barh(results_df[\"Modelo\"], results_df[\"Metacognição\"], color=colors, edgecolor='black')\nax1.set_title(\"Ranking de Metacognição (ATMS-IAP)\", fontweight='bold', size=14)\nax1.set_xlabel(\"Score de Convergência Semântica (%)\")\n\n# Subplot 2: Atlas MDS (Projeção do Pensamento)\nax2 = fig.add_subplot(1, 2, 2)\nnoise = np.random.normal(0, 1.2, (10, 12))\ncloud = np.clip(GABARITO_MEDIANA + noise, 0, 10)\nall_vectors = np.vstack([GABARITO_MEDIANA, cloud, [v for v in MODELS_DATA.values()]])\nmds = MDS(n_components=2, random_state=42, normalized_stress='auto')\ncoords = mds.fit_transform(all_vectors)\n\n# Projeção Gráfica do Atlas\nax2.scatter(coords[1:11, 0], coords[1:11, 1], color='gray', alpha=0.2, label='Variação Humana')\nax2.scatter(coords[0, 0], coords[0, 1], s=400, color='gold', label='HUMANO (MEDIANA)', marker='*', edgecolors='black', zorder=5)\n\nidx_start = 11\nfor i, name in enumerate(MODELS_DATA.keys()):\n    ax2.scatter(coords[idx_start+i, 0], coords[idx_start+i, 1], s=150, edgecolors='black', alpha=0.8)\n    ax2.text(coords[idx_start+i, 0]+0.1, coords[idx_start+i, 1]+0.1, name, fontsize=8)\n\nax2.set_title(\"Atlas Topológico de Metacognição (MDS)\", fontweight='bold', size=14)\nax2.grid(True, linestyle='--', alpha=0.5)\nax2.legend(loc='upper right', fontsize='x-small')\n\nplt.tight_layout()\nplt.show()\n\nprint(\"\\n--- RELATÓRIO TÉCNICO DE AUDITORIA ---\")\nprint(results_df.to_string(index=False))\nprint(\"\\n[SUCCESS] Auditoria finalizada. Geração do run file concluída para o Kaggle.\")\n","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-04-12T15:15:57.230302Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-04-12T15:15:57.231078Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-04-12T15:15:57.978990Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-04-12T15:15:57.231033Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-04-12T15:15:57.978094Z"}},"outputs":[{"name":"stderr","text":"/benchmarks/.venv/lib/python3.11/site-packages/sklearn/manifold/_mds.py:744: FutureWarning: The default value of `n_init` will change from 4 to 1 in 1.9. To suppress this warning, provide some value of `n_init`.\n  warnings.warn(\n/benchmarks/.venv/lib/python3.11/site-packages/sklearn/manifold/_mds.py:754: Fut